Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Keep the page visible when a download starts

Download PDF and Download CSV on a stay-fee report blanked the page behind
the navigation skeleton for 15 seconds, because the skeleton only skipped
URLs that end in a file extension. Downloads now opt out by attribute and by
path ending, and a test scans every template so a new download link cannot
regress it. Adds the task 0002 brief.
